  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A light string passing over a smooth light fixed pulley connects two blocks of masses <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. If the acceleration of the system is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>, then the ratio of masses is</p><img src=\"assets\\qt0032_12c4258b2f50.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 193px;\"/>"
  },
